{"data": [{"author_id": "1987522633983033344", "created_at": "2026-10-30T22:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116296594601472352"], "id": "2116296594601472352", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u4eca\u65e5\u306eX\u6709\u76ca\u60c5\u5831\u306f\u3001\nGrok Bot\u3067\u30d0\u30ba\u5206\u6790\u304b\u3089\u30dd\u30b9\u30c8\u4f5c\u6210\u307e\u3067\u81ea\u52d5\u5316\u3059\u308b7\u3064\u306e\u6d3b\u7528\u8853\u306e\u8a18\u4e8b\u3060\u3063\u305f\u3002\n\n\u8ffd\u52a0\u8ab2\u91d1\u306a\u3057\u3068\u3044\u3046\u89e6\u308c\u8fbc\u307f\u306b\u60f9\u304b\u308c\u305f\u304c\u3001\nChatGPT\u691c\u8a3c\u3067\u306f\u5b9f\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u3092\u6e21\u3055\u306a\u3044\u3068\n\u305d\u306e\u307e\u307e\u3067\u306f\u5f31\u3044\u3068\u6307\u6458\u3055\u308c\u305f\u3002\n\n64\u6b73\u3001\u4fbf\u5229\u3055\u306e\u88cf\u306b\u3042\u308b\u524d\u63d0\u6761\u4ef6\u3092\n\u898b\u843d\u3068\u3055\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3057\u305f\u3044\u3002", "url": "https://x.com/yamasin9/status/2116296594601472352"}, {"author_id": "2114713074976333824", "created_at": "2026-10-30T22:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116296590478774311"], "id": "2116296590478774311", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Last month the bot in charge of creating roles needed its own strict structure.\n\nWithout it, every new bot inherited the same problems.\n\nAfter fixing that, new roles come out cleaner and the bots work better from the start.\n\nWhat\u2019s the biggest issue you see when generating roles", "url": "https://x.com/EfficientBots/status/2116296590478774311"}, {"author_id": "69157643", "created_at": "2026-10-30T22:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116296590046470266"], "id": "2116296590046470266", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The toolbox didn't get old. It got a new crew.\n\nEngineers and managers built a toolbox over the last hundred years: FMEA, Pareto charts, control plans, 5 Whys, Plan-Do-Check-Act, 8D, SPC. They work. Most people reading this have used them, and most have also seen them done", "url": "https://x.com/mrmwisc/status/2116296590046470266"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116296495389638656"]}, "author_id": "1906304624048631808", "created_at": "2026-10-30T22:29:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116296562532032857"], "id": "2116296562532032857", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2036430645724147712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116203726692102240", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kkkeric_ai \u8fd9\u4e2a\u597d\u554a\uff0c\u6211\u4e5f\u53bb\u73a9\uff0c\u8c22\u8c22\u5206\u4eab\u3002\u6211\u7acb\u9a6c\u7528\u6211\u7684Grok Bot\u8d76\u7d27\u53bb\u64cd\u4f5c\uff0c\u54c8\u54c8\u54c8\u54c8\u54c8\u3002 https://t.co/Z2kPqpr75R", "url": "https://x.com/yaohongan2025/status/2116296562532032857"}, {"author_id": "361400345", "created_at": "2026-10-30T22:29:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116296549827539189"], "id": "2116296549827539189", "in_reply_to_user_id": "134321104", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116289233443029382", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@JTLonsdale Look at the time stamp. Grok says a bot made the account and it was active for literally 45 seconds.", "url": "https://x.com/jamesjackson/status/2116296549827539189"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["16_2116296452083179520"]}, "author_id": "44401105", "created_at": "2026-10-30T22:29:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116296517673738668"], "id": "2116296517673738668"